  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When calling Networking.LocalPlayer.GetTrackingData(VRCPlayerApi.TrackingDataType.AvatarRoot).position, the result is always (0, 0, 0) in ClientSim. This used to be equivalent to the origin tracking point, and causes divergent behavior between the editor and in-game.\n\nThis bug has appeared as far back as world SDK 3.5.1 with unity 2022.3.6f1, but may exist earlier than that.\n\nThis also happened around the same time as https://github.com/vrchat-community/ClientSim/issues/118 started popping up - these are likely related in some way, even if not directly.\n\nReproducible in SDK 3.6.1, Unity 2022.3.22f1",
